[en.FOCUS_C04_WASHOUT_TOUR]
Celebration of Dissidents

[en.FOCUS_C04_WASHOUT_TOUR_desc]
Cloudspire can’t stop the Washouts from holding their revels here, but at least we can make sure their audience behaves.

